#   3  23.0  the app closed (Esc), Stop in Music (the chip given back), Programs > OPL2 again:
#            the app is ready
#   4  25.5  its Chords demo playing
#   5  30.0  BAROQUE.MID opened in Files (typed, Enter) meanwhile: Music says the OPL2 is in
#            use
